  - simulation study
abstract: >-
  Interactive teaching dashboard and simulation study on leak alarms in a water
  distribution network. Simulated hourly SCADA with weekday and weekend demand,
  an imperfect maintenance schedule, look-alike events and leaks that run until
  repaired or reported by customers. Rules, an EWMA control chart and logistic
  regression, with and without an operator-visible context check, are compared
  at a common false-alert budget on 40 simulated networks by leaks caught and
  leak water saved. Includes an operator workflow with crew dispatch and crew
  reports. Educational use; zone names, network and readings are fictional and
  not affiliated with any utility.
